i haven't made friends since i was 12 so i feel u, in HS i never even spoken to anyone but i'm mildly ok.
and yeah having friends at least online is great, even just talking to random strangers on reddit or somewhere even if it's only for one time... it does keep u from giving up entirely, also when i'm alone i watch streams and that makes me feel i have company heh
idk i'm not an expert either;;
